## Frozen local law

Let the signed neighbor directions be

```text
D = {+e_x,-e_x,+e_y,-e_y,+e_z,-e_z}.
```

A neighboring Record content is

```text
rho_n = (I + v_n.sigma)/2,     ||v_n|| <= 1.
```

From the six contents form the symmetric trace-free tensor

```text
S(v) = STF[(1/4) sum_n (n v_n^T + v_n n^T)].
```

The one-site possibility menu is frozen before target execution to the six
axis Bloch directions `+/-e_i` and eight corner Bloch directions
`c/sqrt(3)`, `c in {+/-1}^3`.  With `tau=1/24`, define

```text
p_(+/-e_i) = 1/12 + (tau/2) S_ii,
p_c         = 1/16 + (3 tau/8)
              (S_xy c_x c_y + S_yz c_y c_z + S_xz c_x c_z).
```

Let

```text
M(p) = STF[sum_d p_d d d^T],
Q_source(p) = -32 M(p).
```

No coefficient in these formulas may change after H1, H2, or held-out target
execution.

For target-only positive controls, convert a trace-free spatial tensor `Q`
to six neighboring Record contents by the single frozen preparation

```text
v_n(Q) = -(3/4) Q n.
```

The corner attached to sign triple `c` is not a diagonal site.  It is the
equal mixture of the three selected neighbor contents, with Bloch vector

```text
b_c = (v_(c_x e_x)+v_(c_y e_y)+v_(c_z e_z))/3 = -Q c/4.
```

This preparation is a reachability witness, not permission to pass `Q`, TT
coefficients, or a source tensor to the runtime law.  The runtime interface is
only the six `rho_n` Record contents.

## Frozen stages and gates

### Stage A — universal Admissibility kernel

For every six-tuple of valid Bloch vectors, prove exact normalization, strict
nonnegative probabilities, nonconstancy, translation covariance, and 24/24
proper-cubic covariance.  Prove the exact moment identity `M=tau S`.  Express
the rule as a law-level distribution on one-site `M2` possibilities, not as an
observer querying an unreadable state.

### Stage B — exact H1/H2 common source

Use the normalized spatial symmetric-tensor basis already frozen in Block 08:
diagonal slots `(xx,yy,zz)` and off-diagonal basis elements with entries
`1/sqrt(2)`.  For H1 and H2 separately require:

- all six prepared neighboring states and all eight composite-corner mixtures
  are positive;
- `Q_source` equals the exact fixture tensor coefficient by coefficient;
- all 24 proper-cubic images use the same preparation and law;
- the native forward and literal actual-reverse maps reproduce the exact full
  source, with common rank five and no fixture-specific gain.

### Stage C — post-freeze open-family holdout

Prove symbolically, not by fitting samples, that the same law is injective and
returns `Q` on the five-parameter family

```text
Q(a,b,d,e,f) = [[a,d,e],[d,b,f],[e,f,-a-b]]
```

through an open neighborhood containing the rational box
`|a|,|b|,|d|,|e|,|f| <= 1/4`.  Establish positive neighbor and composite-corner
states on that box.  Deterministic post-freeze samples may falsify the symbolic
identity but cannot replace it.

### Stage D — physical ownership and joint typing

Scan the actual runtime dependency graph.  `OWNED-COMMON` requires that the
probabilities are forward-generated solely from six causal-past neighboring
Record contents and that the action-factor/clock input used by the native
source can be placed in the same `M2` conditions or an already typed local
relay.  It fails this gate if it reads target `Q`, H1/H2, TT/source
coefficients, `p`, `q`, a fixture/orbit label, diagonal sites, same-event
post-state, or a downstream M4 state.

An algebraically exact spin-two distribution with no action-state solder,
causal preparation, or joint `M2` typing is `CAPACITY-ONLY`, not physical
ownership.  Formation site/rate, realized draw, permanent-Record mechanism,
history, and clock normalization remain separate downstream obligations even
after `OWNED-COMMON`.

## Frozen outcomes

- `OWNED-COMMON`: Stages A--D pass without a new primitive or target-fed
  runtime input.
- `CAPACITY-ONLY`: the fixed kernel spans/reproduces the common source but
  preparation, joint action-state typing, or held-out ownership is not proved.
- `NO-MEMBER`: the frozen law fails positivity, covariance, H1/H2 exactness,
  native forward/reverse reproduction, or the symbolic open family.

There is no same-campaign coefficient change, ansatz enlargement, fixture
lookup, favorable normalization, or target-specific repair.  A negative or
